Duplat & Tran-Ha site-index curves (1997)
-----------------------------------------
Reference: Duplat, P., Tran-Ha, M. (1997). "Modèles de croissance
           en hauteur dominante pour le chêne sessile, le chêne
           pédonculé, le hêtre et le sapin en France."
License  : publication IFN — redistribution terms to be confirmed
           before shipping the embedded curves (see spec 005 phase 2,
           task T2.1).
Usage    : Site-index estimation (P2 indicator) when a CHM is
           available (spec 005 phase 2).

Third-party attributions in source code
---------------------------------------
All data-source metadata (URLs, providers, licenses) are declared in
JSON configuration files under `inst/datasources/*.json` and read via
`get_country_config()` / `get_data_source()`.
